---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="PECH Labs"
  description="PECH Labs is an applied-AI venture studio inside Pech Group. We design, deploy, and operate autonomous AI agents for executive workflows — research, reporting, back-office orchestration, and briefing automation. AI Agents as a Service."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="labs-hero">
    <div class="labs-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="labs-hero__grid"></div>
      <div class="labs-hero__glow"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container labs-hero__inner">
      <div class="labs-badge">PECH Labs</div>
      <h1 class="labs-hero__headline">
        We built AI agents<br/>
        <span class="labs-hero__accent">for ourselves first.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="labs-hero__sub">
        PECH Labs is our applied-AI venture studio. We don't sell AI strategy —
        we run our own firm on autonomous agents, then productize what works.
        We are customer zero.
      </p>
      <div class="labs-hero__ctas">
        <a href="#agents" class="btn btn--primary">See What We're Building</a>
        <a href="/contact?ref=labs" class="btn btn--outline">Request Early Access</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What is PECH Labs -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container labs-intro">
      <div class="labs-intro__text">
        <span class="section__label">What It Is</span>
        <div class="gold-line"></div>
        <h2>An AI venture studio<br/>inside the firm.</h2>
        <p>
          PECH Labs exists at the intersection of our executive advisory practice
          and the new generation of autonomous AI technology. We started by asking
          a simple question: which of our own workflows — research, competitive
          intelligence, executive briefings, reporting, back-office coordination —
          could be reliably automated by AI agents?
        </p>
        <p>
          The answer was: most of them. So we built agents to do exactly that.
          Then we productized the result.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, PECH Labs is where that product lives — and where we continue
          to push the frontier of what autonomous agents can do for executives
          and operating companies.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="labs-intro__principles">
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Customer zero</h4>
            <p>We operate what we sell. Every agent we offer to clients has been running inside our own firm first.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
          <div>
            <h4>No AI hype</h4>
            <p>We describe what our agents actually do. No vague promises, no fabricated case studies, no capability theatre.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle__icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Executive-grade</h4>
            <p>Built for the workflows that matter at the leadership level — not generic chatbot applications.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Flagship: AI Agents as a Service -->
  <section class="section section--off" id="agents">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label">Flagship Offering</span>
      <h2 class="section__heading">AI Agents as a Service.</h2>
      <p class="section__sub">
        We design, deploy, and operate autonomous AI agents that handle real
        business workflows — so your team spends less time on information
        overhead and more time on decisions.
      </p>

      <div class="agents-grid">
        <div class="agent-card">
          <div class="agent-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Research Agent</h3>
          <p>Continuous competitive intelligence, market monitoring, and briefing synthesis — delivered on your cadence, without analyst overhead.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="agent-card">
          <div class="agent-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Reporting Agent</h3>
          <p>Automated generation of executive dashboards, board reports, and performance summaries — structured, accurate, and always on time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="agent-card">
          <div class="agent-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Briefing Agent</h3>
          <p>Daily executive briefings synthesized from your selected sources — news, internal data, and priority signals — formatted for how you actually think.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="agent-card">
          <div class="agent-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Back-Office Orchestration</h3>
          <p>Routine operational workflows — scheduling coordination, data aggregation, document processing — handled by agents so your team doesn't have to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who it's for -->
  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section__label" style="color:var(--gold)">Who It's For</span>
      <h2 style="color:var(--white); margin-bottom:1rem;">Built for executives<br/>and operating companies.</h2>
      <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); max-width:56ch; margin-bottom:3rem;">
        PECH Labs is not a consumer AI product. It's an enterprise service for
        leaders who want real leverage from AI — without building and maintaining
        the infrastructure themselves.
      </p>
      <div class="audience-grid">
        <div class="audience-card">
          <h4>Fractional and portfolio executives</h4>
          <p>Managing multiple engagements requires information velocity. Our agents give you the briefing layer you need across all your portfolios.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <h4>Founders and CEOs</h4>
          <p>You're already running lean. Deploy agents to handle the research, reporting, and administrative overhead that shouldn't require a hire.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="audience-card">
          <h4>Boards and investors</h4>
          <p>Portfolio monitoring, diligence research, and reporting synthesis — delivered by agents that don't need time zones or weekends.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Early access CTA -->
  <section class="section labs-cta">
    <div class="container labs-cta__inner">
      <div class="labs-cta__badge" aria-hidden="true">Launching Soon</div>
      <h2>Join the early access list.</h2>
      <p>
        We're onboarding a limited number of early clients to shape the product.
        If you're curious — or ready — we want to hear from you.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact?ref=labs" class="btn btn--primary">Request Early Access</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .labs-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: var(--navy);
    min-height: 80vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .labs-hero__bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .labs-hero__grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(202,173,135,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(202,173,135,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
  }
  .labs-hero__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(202,173,135,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .labs-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 6rem 0;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .labs-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.3);
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .labs-hero__headline {
    color: var(--white);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .labs-hero__accent { color: var(--gold); }
  .labs-hero__sub {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .labs-hero__ctas { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* Intro */
  .labs-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .labs-intro__text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }
  .labs-intro__text h2 { margin: 0.5rem 0; }
  .labs-intro__principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  .principle {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .principle__icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .principle h4 { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .principle p { font-size: 0.875rem; }

  /* Agents grid */
  .agents-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .agent-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(1,8,45,0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .agent-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(1,8,45,0.08);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .agent-card__icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    background: rgba(202,173,135,0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .agent-card__icon svg {
    width: 20px; height: 20px;
    stroke: var(--gold);
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .agent-card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.65rem; }
  .agent-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; }

  /* Audience */
  .audience-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .audience-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.12);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem;
  }
  .audience-card h4 {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }
  .audience-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); }

  /* CTA */
  .labs-cta { background: var(--off-white); }
  .labs-cta__inner {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .labs-cta__badge {
    padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(202,173,135,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(202,173,135,0.3);
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .labs-cta h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .labs-cta p { color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .labs-intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  }
</style>
